+
+- Variational approximation, not exact posterior inference
+- Physics term is a soft penalty against the simulator's own physics
+- MC epistemic spread and the approximate mean ± 1.96σ band are not calibrated coverage intervals
+
+Fidelity: rung 1 of the fidelity ladder - simulator data, surrogate waveforms where stated, proxy RUL targets and simulator fault labels. Results are comparable **within** this collection and are not field-validated turbine control.
